	(text "TMC2209 SilentStepStick socket  --  one driver channel"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 24 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 4 4)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "80daa624-ad93-5798-a354-408a6f7e1c83")
	)
	(text "Pinout and pad geometry from Watterott SilentStepStick-TMC2209 v2.0. Import this sheet once per driver."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 31 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(bold no)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "bc2f1ca5-f1b0-5596-8019-2cbc8ab7b1e3")
	)
	(text "A1 is the socket, not the driver: 2 x 1x08 female headers on 2.54 mm, 12.7 mm apart, plus the DIAG / VREF / INDEX aux pads."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 200 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(bold no)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "9f8f439a-d6f5-5b51-8be0-8446a8443a26")
	)
	(text "Pads 13 and 14 are the two PDN_UART positions on the module. Only one of them is live -- the module jumper picks which -- so both are"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 205.5 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(bold no)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "9501c721-3e47-5fdd-8ae2-c21b2cf6ae22")
	)
	(text "    tied to the same net and the socket works either way. R2 (1k) is the series resistor Trinamic requires on the single-wire UART;"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 211 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(bold no)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "e848cb96-c409-5a8d-bf34-e4abaa2b8bcb")
	)
	(text "    the parent joins MCU TX and RX at the UART sheet pin."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 216.5 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(bold no)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "f504d23c-8888-5396-9ecf-295094094adc")
	)
	(text "MS1 = address bit 0, MS2 = address bit 1. Both have pull-downs on the module, so an unconnected sheet pin means UART address 0."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 222 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(bold no)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "a6da0632-5f29-5923-b4ad-18d3855dd301")
	)
	(text "SPREAD low = stealthChop, high = spreadCycle (module pull-down). Leave the sheet pin open for stealthChop."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 227.5 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(bold no)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "cd3649f2-b9ed-52ed-b2f9-77b773ee56d3")
	)
	(text "EN is active low. R1 pulls it up to VIO so the outputs stay off while the MCU pin is still an input at reset."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 233 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(bold no)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "49a4e2e8-ea76-56ed-a846-143d6b2b3dbe")
	)
	(text "C1 is not optional: Watterott asks for at least 100 uF of local bulk on VM, within ~10 mm of the socket. VM range 5.5 - 28 V,"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 238.5 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(bold no)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "092955af-4dfa-5af2-9fc9-3dadb7b9c72a")
	)
	(text "    VIO 3.3 - 5 V. Both arrive as sheet pins -- the parent has to drive them."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 244 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(bold no)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "e7df760f-3a2d-5489-af6c-bfa6a6d735de")
	)
	(text "VREF is the analog current-set reference. Brought out to TP1 only; the module ships with no pin fitted in that hole."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 249.5 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(bold no)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "d8436a57-813e-5325-862e-f80965f2d77e")
	)
	(text "Motor coils: M1A / M1B are one coil, M2A / M2B the other. Never unplug a motor with VM live."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 255 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(bold no)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "ef8292dc-96b0-5268-8305-3b1193d80e2c")
	)
	(sheet_instances
		(path "/"
			(page "1")
		)
	)
	(embedded_fonts no)
)
